<title>UK: 3i names Michael Queen finance director.</title>
<headline>3i names Michael Queen finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British investment firm 3i Group Plc said on Thursday that Michael Queen would take over as finance director in July.  </p>
<p>Queen, who will be an executive director with effect from the annual general meeting in July, will succeed Brian Larcombe as finance director from that date.</p>
<p>Queen has been with the firm since 1987, previously as group financial controller.</p>
<p>As previously announced, Larcombe will succeed Ewen Macpherson as chief executive.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
